msgstr "Sokongan Kad Pintar"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 42
#: rc.cpp:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Enable smartcard support"
msgstr "Bol&ehkan sokongan kad pintar"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 61
#: rc.cpp:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable &polling to autodetect card events"
msgstr "Hidu&pkan polling untuk autokesan acara kad"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 64
#: rc.cpp:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In most cases you should have this enabled. It allows KDE to automatically "
"detect card insertion and reader hotplug events."
msgstr ""
"Dalam kebanyakan kes anda patut hidupkan ini, kerana membolehkan KDE "
"mengesan kemasukan kad secara automatik dan tugas pembaca hotplug"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 92
#: rc.cpp:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatically &launch card manager if inserted card is unclaimed"
msgstr ""
"&Lancarkan pengurus kad secara automatik jika kad dimasukkan tidak dituntut"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 95
#: rc.cpp:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you insert a smartcard, KDE can automatically launch a management tool "
"if no other application attempts to use the card."
msgstr ""
"Apabila anda masukkan kad pintar, KDE secara automatik akan melancarkan "
"alatan pengurusan jika tiada aplikasi lain cuba menggunakan kad"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file smartcardbase.ui line 106
#: rc.cpp:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Beep on card insert and removal"
msgstr "&Beep apabila kad masuk dan keluar"

